{"id":27115,"author":"Sp4rrkii","body":"\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003eWelcome to my new map, by the name of \u003cb\u003eTartarus\u003c/b\u003e, hope everyone likes it!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eDetails\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTeam colours \u0026gt; Red and Green\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMonuments \u0026gt; 2\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003eThings at mid \u0026gt; Diamonds and a chest with golden apples and xp bottles\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003eBoth teams have a enchantment table directly in-front of spawn ( I'd also like to note that if someone does the XML, can they do it so you get 3 exp bottles every kill? )\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAuthor \u0026gt; Turboh\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAlbum \u0026gt;\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/8s8kO\" title=\"Link: http://imgur.com/a/8s8kO\"\u003ehttp://imgur.com/a/8s8kO\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCould map devs also let me know relatively soon on this map and some of my others if they will get accepted/when they will get reviewed?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThanks,\u003cbr\u003eTurboh","body_tagged":"\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003eWelcome to my new map, by the name of \u003cb\u003eTartarus\u003c/b\u003e, hope everyone likes it!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eDetails\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTeam colours \u0026gt; Red and Green\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMonuments \u0026gt; 2\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003eThings at mid \u0026gt; Diamonds and a chest with golden apples and xp bottles\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003eBoth teams have a enchantment table directly in-front of spawn ( I'd also like to note that if someone does the XML, can they do it so you get 3 exp bottles every kill? )\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAuthor \u0026gt; Turboh\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAlbum \u0026gt;\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/8s8kO\" title=\"Link: http://imgur.com/a/8s8kO\"\u003ehttp://imgur.com/a/8s8kO\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCould map devs also let me know relatively soon on this map and some of my others if they will get accepted/when they will get reviewed?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThanks,\u003cbr\u003eTurboh","created_at":1491746341,"title":"TARTARUS (Dtm) by Turboh","replies":[{"id":365768,"author":"JeTePardonne","body":"Sweet :=)","body_tagged":"Sweet :=)","created_at":1491791871},{"id":365771,"author":"Rivzz","body":"Hands down, I want to play this.","body_tagged":"Hands down, I want to play this.","created_at":1491793934},{"id":365782,"author":"cellish","body":"Saw this one and I like it!\u003cbr\u003eGj!\u003cbr\u003e+1\u003cbr\u003e(Name change from tartarus to Tartaros?)","body_tagged":"Saw this one and I like it!\u003cbr\u003eGj!\u003cbr\u003e+1\u003cbr\u003e(Name change from tartarus to Tartaros?)","created_at":1491808491},{"id":365796,"author":"Myv","body":"As I said before you are a natural at this lol","body_tagged":"As I said before you are a natural at this lol","created_at":1491822664},{"id":365802,"author":"Sp4rrkii","body":"Thanks for the support guys ;)","body_tagged":"Thanks for the support guys ;)","created_at":1491825573},{"id":365803,"author":"Sp4rrkii","body":"\u003cdiv class=\"row-fluid\" style=\"width: 785.734px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"span1\" style=\"float: left; min-height: 1px; margin-left: 0px; width: 47px; box-sizing: border-box; padding-top: 3px; margin-right: 5px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/Ehlf\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration-line: none;\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"round-mini\" src=\"https://crafatar.com/avatars/50a34639abb34cf1b182204756c49f49?helm\u0026amp;size=45\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: auto; heigh